@startuml
title Entrega HOME — identidad, saga durable y recuperación
skinparam shadowing false
actor Bibliotecario as B
participant ApiGateway as G
participant AuthService as A
participant OrdersService as O
participant ClientsService as C
participant InventoryService as I
participant PaymentsService as P
participant NotificationService as N
B -> G : POST /api/requests/{id}/issue\nBearer + RUN + muestra TEST
G -> A : POST /introspect\nHTTPS + HMAC gateway→auth
A --> G : principal LIBRARIAN vigente
G -> O : POST /requests/{id}/issue\nnueva identidad firmada gateway→orders
O -> C : GET /eligibility/{reader}\nPOST /verify (RUN + evidencia)
C --> O : activo + verificado (adaptador TEST)
O -> O : tx local: REQUEST=ISSUING\nLOAN=PREPARING, ID determinista
O -> I : POST /commit(requestId,loanId)\nHMAC orders→inventory
I -> I : tx: HELD→HOME\nplazos por ítem, commit idempotente
I --> O : items + issuedAt + dueAt servidor
O -> P : POST /assessments(loanId,readerId)
alt payments disponible
  P -> P : tx: EXEMPT, 0 CLP, PK loanId
  P --> O : evaluación idempotente
  O -> O : tx: LOAN=ACTIVE, REQUEST=ISSUED\nOUTBOX comprobante
  O --> G : 200 LoanDTO
  G --> B : comprobante imprimible
else timeout / 5xx
  O --> G : 502 DEPENDENCY_UNAVAILABLE
  G --> B : error sanitizado + correlationId
  note over O,I
  No deshacer a ciegas: inventory pudo confirmar.
  ISSUING no admite cancelación.
  end note
  O -> I : worker reintenta /commit MISMO ID
  I --> O : mismo resultado; no doble préstamo
  O -> P : worker reintenta /assessments MISMO loanId
  P --> O : una sola evaluación
  O -> O : finaliza ACTIVE + OUTBOX
end
O -> N : worker POST /events(receipt-loanId)
N --> O : aceptado / duplicado idéntico
note over N
API de correo TEST, persistente y con reintentos.
No se afirma entrega por Internet.
end note
@enduml
